#Problem APEX 2.6.15

DOCUMENT();
loadMacros('PGstandard.pl', 'PGML.pl', 'PGchoicemacros.pl', 'PGcourse.pl');

## DBsubject(Calculus - single variable)
## DBchapter(Differentiation)
## DBsection(Implicit differentiation)
## KEYWORDS('derivative', 'implicit')
## Institution(Valdosta State University)
## Author(S. V. Ault)
## MLT(trig_only)
## Level(2)
## MO(1)
## TitleText1('APEX Calculus')
## AuthorText1('Hartman')
## EditionText1('3.0')
## Section1('2.6')
## Problem1('15')
## Edited July 2023

$a1 = random(2, 7);
$b1 = random(2, 7);
$b2 = 2 * $b1;
$c1 = random(2, 7);

$f = "$a1 \sin x  + $b1 \cos y";
$g = "$c1";

Context("Numeric")->variables->add(y => 'Real');

$ans = Compute("$a1 cos(x) / ($b1 sin(y))")->reduce;

BEGIN_PGML

Find [`` \frac{dy}{dx} ``] for the following implicitly defined function, using implicit differentiation.

[```  [$f] = [$g].```]

    [` \dfrac{dy}{dx} = `] [_]{$ans}{25}

END_PGML

BEGIN_PGML_SOLUTION

[``
  \begin{aligned}
   \dfrac{d}{dx}[[$f]] &= \dfrac{d}{dx}[[$g]]\\
   [$a1] \cos x - [$b1] \sin y \dfrac{dy}{dx} &= 0 \\
   \dfrac{dy}{dx} &= \dfrac{[$a1] \cos x}{[$b1] \sin y}
  \end{aligned}
``]
END_PGML_SOLUTION

ENDDOCUMENT();
